sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant API as API Controller
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant FS as OfferService
    participant VS as VoucherService
    participant ES as EscrowService
    participant SM as OrderStateMachine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor H as Helper
    C->>API: POST /orders {helper_id, kategori, alamat, estimasi, voucher}
    API->>OS: create(client, data)
    OS->>DB: Cek helper verified, available, tidak sibuk, menguasai kategori
    OS->>DB: INSERT orders status awaiting_quote, quote_deadline_at = now + 300 detik
    OS-->>API: order
    API-->>C: 201 awaiting_quote
    API-->>H: Notifikasi permintaan pesanan
    H->>API: POST /orders/{id}/offers {proposed_price}
    API->>FS: submitQuote(order, helper, price)
    FS->>DB: INSERT order_offers submitted, valid_until = now + 300 detik
    API-->>C: Notifikasi quote masuk
    C->>API: POST /orders/{id}/offers/{offer_id}/select + X-Idempotency-Key
    API->>FS: approve(order, offer, key)
    FS->>DB: BEGIN, kunci baris helper dan dompet client
    FS->>VS: validateOnApproval(order, proposed_price)
    VS-->>FS: diskon voucher, maksimal komisi kotor
    FS->>ES: hold(order, key)
    ES->>DB: Kurangi available_balance, tambah held_balance, INSERT wallet_transactions hold
    FS->>SM: transition(order, accepted)
    SM->>DB: UPDATE orders, INSERT order_status_history
    FS->>DB: Permintaan lain ke helper yang masih awaiting_quote menjadi expired
    FS->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>C: 200 accepted, held_amount
    API-->>H: Notifikasi pesanan diterima
